WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.971
The applied project combines several concepts We
sequence admissions

00:00:05.997 --> 00:00:12.850
for each patient LAG retrieves the previous
discharge A

00:00:12.877 --> 00:00:18.637
second CTE calculates the gap The final query joins
patient

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:24.334
names and classifies whether the new admission
occurred within thirty days This

00:00:24.347 --> 00:00:26.900
is a practical sequence-analysis pipeline
